# Created by local restructuring (Milestone 1, prepared not committed):
# this project had no .gitignore of its own in the monorepo — it relied
# entirely on ai-business-automation's root .gitignore, including two
# rules written specifically for this project's paths. Now standalone,
# it needs its own copy of the generic rules plus those two, with the
# "sales-recovery-agent/" prefix removed since this is now the repo root.

# Dependencies
node_modules/

# Build output
dist/
dist-ssr/
build/

# Env
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Local SQLite databases (conversation memory, etc.)
*.sqlite
*.sqlite3
*.db

# Logs
npm-debug.log*
yarn-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
*.log

# Editor
.vscode/*
!.vscode/extensions.json
.idea/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# TypeScript
*.tsbuildinfo

# --- Project-specific (translated from the monorepo root .gitignore) ---
# Local Chroma server data (RAG vector store) — regenerated via `npm run
# ingest`, not source content. data/kb/ (the actual knowledge-base
# documents) is NOT covered by this and stays committed.
server/data/chroma/

# Generated evaluation run output (JSON per run) — eval/dataset.json (the
# source dataset) is NOT covered by this and stays committed.
server/eval-results/
